  "methodology": {
    "weights": {
      "market_traction": 0.25,
      "user": 0.35,
      "product": 0.4
    },
    "market_traction": "Mean of Footprint and Momentum. Footprint: mean of traffic score (5 - 1.2*(log10(Tranco rank)-3), clamped 1-5; suite-level domains use volume only) and review-volume score (1 + 1.6*(log10(total reviews)-1), clamped 1-5). Momentum: annualized review-count growth vs an Internet Archive snapshot of the same public page, scored 2 + 6*growth, clamped 1-5; capped at 3.5 when absolute gain < 20 reviews; requires a >= 120-day window; tools without a usable archive get a neutral 2.5 prior, never their footprint alone.",
    "user": "Average of public G2 and Capterra ratings weighted by review count, cited as dated facts.",
    "product": "Expert rubric + vendor submittals. DRAFT until founder markup.",
    "collection": "Manual, logged-out citation of public pages, search listings, and Internet Archive snapshots. No accounts, no scraping, no bot-defense bypass.",
    "momentum_rationale": "All-time review totals reward incumbency. Momentum measures direction of travel from a dated baseline forward, so a 3-year-old product competes on current trajectory, not accumulated history. Known limitation: velocity partly reflects vendor review campaigns; anomalous spikes are flagged and re-verified at the next refresh."
  },
